            <meta name="description" content="Your Future Awaits at Clark State! Clark State has been a cornerstone of higher education since 1962. Students say that convenient campus locations, low cost and in-demand programs are some of the most important reasons they decide to enroll. Take a look and see how Clark State can help make your goals a reality!" />
