        <div class="lyt-sixty-forty__sixty util-logo-background">


<h2 class="cmp-headline">Your Future Starts            <span class="cmp-headline__accent">at Clark State!</span>
</h2>            <p>At Clark State College, we believe education should meet you where you are. Since 1962, we’ve been helping students from all walks of life reach their goals through affordable, high-quality programs. With locations in Springfield, Beavercreek, Bellefontaine and Xenia — and flexible options like online, evening and weekend classes — Clark State makes it easy to learn on your schedule. Whether you’re starting college for the first time, finishing a degree or building skills for your career, we’ll be with you every step of the way.</p>
        </div>
    </div>
</div>


